msgid "层标准化 （Layer Normalization）"
msgstr "Layer Normalization"

#: ../../zh/examples/03_layer_norm_example.md:3
msgid "在本节中，我们将使用 Triton 编写一个比 PyTorch 实现运行更快的高性能层标准化 (Layer Normalization) 内核。"
msgstr ""
"In this section, you will use Triton to write a high-performance "
"layernormalization kernel that runs faster than the PyTorch "
"implementation."

#: ../../zh/examples/03_layer_norm_example.md:5
msgid "计算内核"
msgstr "Compute Kernel"

#: ../../zh/examples/03_layer_norm_example.md:64
msgid "使用 Triton 自定义的 LayerNorm 实现方式"
msgstr "LayerNorm Implementation Defined by Using Triton"

#: ../../zh/examples/03_layer_norm_example.md:115
msgid "结果"
msgstr "Result"

#: ../../zh/examples/03_layer_norm_example.md:171
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"“Layer Normalization 128,128 torch.float16 PASSED!”、 “Layer Normalization"
" 128,128 torch.bfloat16 PASSED!”、 “Layer Normalization 128,128 "
"torch.float32 PASSED!” "
"表明Triton和PyTorch上float16、bfloat16、float32数据类型的输出结果完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"\"Layer Normalization 128,128 torch.float16 PASSED!\", \"Layer "
"Normalization 128,128 torch.bfloat16 PASSED!\", and \"Layer Normalization"
" 128,128 torch.float32 PASSED!\" indicate that the output of float16, "
"bfloat16, and float32 data typeson Triton is the same as that on PyTorch."

